Package: r-cornball-runix
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, r-base-core (>= 4.6.0), r-api-4.0, r-cornball-janssonr
Description: common core for the Runix system-administration framework
 Runix is an R-native Linux system-administration framework. This package is
 its common core: durable two-phase audit, the compiled AF_UNIX client for the
 privileged audit broker, and the shared result/condition model the subsystem
 packages build on.
 .
 Experimental. Part of Runix (https://github.com/cornball-ai/runix).
